sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If as many odd numbers as we please are added together, and their multitude is odd, then the sum is also odd.
----
proof:

Let as many odd numbers as we please, {AB}, {BC}, and {CD}, the multitude of which is odd, be added together.

I say that the sum {AD} is also odd.

